#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:1 e491e7f0e72c443392324c10fc30de44
msgid "📦 [Bookshelf - 4.0.0](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/releases/tag/v4.0.0)"
msgstr "📦 [Bookshelf - 4.0.0](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/releases/tag/v4.0.0)"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:3 c1f98b8bfd3049ed95ca5787e8eeb9da
msgid "**🧹 The Tiny Sweep Update!**"
msgstr "**🧹 清理更新！**"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:5 88b4202faea1435cb40843680587aad5
msgid "*First release for Minecraft's new date-based versioning, dropping support for previous versions.*"
msgstr "*首个针对Minecraft新日期版本号的发布，放弃对旧版本的支持。*"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:7 ef59c89591684d6ea2a508e7724bc48d
msgid "**⚠️ BREAKING CHANGES**: This version has breaking changes!"
msgstr "**⚠️ 破坏性变更**：此版本包含破坏性变更！"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:9 f77570384f5b468aaebe27e55b595f36
msgid "Bookshelf is now based on **Minecraft 26.1**."
msgstr "Bookshelf 现已基于 **Minecraft 26.1**。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:12 2c70032bc6844ac9ab95985ae46a9024
msgid "`🧱 bs.block`"
msgstr "`🧱 bs.block`"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:14 725f16a73c5045f09d0ed44d1b202da6
msgid "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - Removed multi-tick fill operations (`fill_block`, `fill_type`, `fill_random`). Use the new `bs.generation` module for async iteration with callbacks."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - 移除多刻填充操作（`fill_block`、`fill_type`、`fill_random`）。请使用新的 `bs.generation` 模块进行带回调的异步迭代。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:15 ../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:43
#: 16fa8d1ab69843dca87b8ca96fa559bb ea52a7e3d6f749d8b053d2bc6184aa8a
msgid "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#523](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/523)** - Removed deprecated functions and tags from previous versions."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#523](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/523)** - 移除先前版本中已弃用的函数和标签。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:16 92a03272a29242c49494f1146937f85e
msgid "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#525](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/525)** - Removed NBT concatenation from block output. State and NBT are now returned as separate fields."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"破坏性变更\">⚠️</abbr> **[#525](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/525)** - 从方块输出中移除了 NBT 拼接。状态和 NBT 现在分别作为独立字段返回。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:17 b83b69321c60410d87b594e2815529b9
msgid "<abbr title=\"Enhancements\">⚡</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - Simplified `fill_block` to use the vanilla `fill` command (single-tick execution)."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"增强\">⚡</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - 简化了`fill_block`，使其使用原版`fill`命令（单刻执行）。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:18 54e51fd7b20146baae991b811d55a57e
msgid "<abbr title=\"Enhancements\">⚡</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - Simplified `fill_type` with a cleaner recursion model (single-tick execution)."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"增强\">⚡</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - 使用更清晰的递归模型简化了`fill_type`（单刻执行）。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:21 7df571d2698d491b95ad37fcb09fe54d
msgid "`🔬 bs.dump`"
msgstr "`🔬 bs.dump`"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:23 4e356cdedef547169300c0012f253b68
msgid "<abbr title=\"Bug Fix\">🐛</abbr> **[#524](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/524)** - Updated `#bs.dump:var` for compatibility with Minecraft 26.1."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"错误修复\">🐛</abbr> **[#524](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/524)** - 更新了`#bs.dump:var`以兼容Minecraft 26.1。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:26 546e1f43387041ffb764d7a401caa2bf
msgid "`⛰️ bs.environment`"
msgstr "`⛰️ bs.environment`"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:28 8d116082b72b41adb4c624bbb84e9e0c
msgid "<abbr title=\"Bug Fix\">🐛</abbr> **[#527](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/527)** - Fixed the different features of the module for Minecraft 26.1. Please, note that between previous Minecraft version and this one, the number of elapsed days has been reset to 0."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"错误修复\">🐛</abbr> **[#527](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/527)** - 修复了模块中针对Minecraft 26.1的不同特性。请注意，在之前的Minecraft版本与本版本之间，经过的天数已重置为0。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:32 9280deace46a43f0bb8f6589a154543e
msgid "`🌱 bs.generation`"
msgstr "`🌱 bs.generation`"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:34 fd29f8d90cde43e497ab8871b39e762a
msgid "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - Complete module rework. Replaced `gen_shape_2d`, `gen_fractal_shape_2d`, and `gen_simplex_shape_2d` with a generic iteration system."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - 模块完全重写。用通用迭代系统替换了 `gen_shape_2d`、`gen_fractal_shape_2d` 和 `gen_simplex_shape_2d`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:35 69f067659ee5404f86bee22f15ffdb66
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - Added `on_cuboid` for 3D iteration over a cubic region with configurable direction, spacing, and tick limit."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - 新增 `on_cuboid`，用于在立方体区域上进行3D迭代，支持方向、间距和刻数限制配置。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:36 2134dcc63c494f1998270e005d3fe017
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - Added `on_rectangle` for 2D iteration over a rectangular region with configurable direction, spacing, and tick limit."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - 新增 `on_rectangle`，用于在矩形区域上进行2D迭代，支持方向、间距和刻数限制配置。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:37 d22b163aa2674134b2bbfb89c619805e
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - Added predefined callbacks: `set_block`, `set_block_type`, `set_random_block`, `fractal_noise_2d`, and `simplex_noise_2d`."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#509](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/509)** - 新增预定义回调：`set_block`、`set_block_type`、`set_random_block`、`fractal_noise_2d` 和 `simplex_noise_2d`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:38 77b287ee621f467cbab0d48a93699571
msgid "<abbr title=\"Bug Fix\">🐛</abbr> **[#435](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/435)** - Configurable iteration direction now allows accommodating mask offsets when blocks are updated during iteration."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Bug Fix\">🐛</abbr> **[#435](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/435)** - 可配置的迭代方向现在能够在迭代过程中更新方块时适应遮罩偏移。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:41 84964126c235488b83d00fb8ebc93a1a
msgid "`🎯 bs.hitbox`"
msgstr "`🎯 bs.hitbox`"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:44 1c7322cfb1cc42b89995f2ede69ad822
msgid "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#532](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/532)** - Removed fluids from the `intangible` block tag to simplify the use of hitbox providers."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#532](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/532)** - 从 `intangible` 方块标签中移除了流体，以简化碰撞箱提供者的使用。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:45 97af56b370cf47518920947dfaa7ba5d
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#532](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/532)** - Updated entity hitboxes for Minecraft 26.1."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#532](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/532)** - 更新了 Minecraft 26.1 的实体碰撞箱。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:48 fde59438af24427694408a432b4c4fd0
msgid "`🏃 bs.move`"
msgstr "`🏃 bs.move`"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:50 1d9c38b445a545b2a1afd609ca303a7c
msgid "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#523](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/523)** - Removed deprecated arguments from previous versions."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#523](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/issues/523)** - 移除了先前版本中已弃用的参数。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:53 40cb7a05d9d3403eabf6c73cbc2938af
msgid "`🔦 bs.raycast`"
msgstr "`🔦 bs.raycast`"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:55 3eee457eb1614b3389e942db119696a7
msgid "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - Removed deprecated `bs:out raycast` and `bs:lambda raycast` storage data."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - 移除了已弃用的 `bs:out raycast` 和 `bs:lambda raycast` 存储数据。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:56 a35700ca972b44bba4d04af112a73bfb
msgid "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - Renamed `on_hit_point` callback to `on_entry_point`. Added new `on_exit_point` callback."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - 将 `on_hit_point` 回调重命名为 `on_entry_point`。新增了 `on_exit_point` 回调。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:57 7e30dc1d8fde4b7ea1424603f0594578
msgid "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - Renamed `$raycast.distance` to `$raycast.entry_distance`. Added `$raycast.exit_distance`."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - 将 `$raycast.distance` 重命名为 `$raycast.entry_distance`。新增了 `$raycast.exit_distance`。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:58 fc18b27c13bb49e891004e85a7f32ea3
msgid "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - Replaced `$raycast.pierce_distance` (delta) with `$raycast.prev_entry_distance` and `$raycast.prev_exit_distance` (absolute values). Compute deltas manually for more flexibility (e.g., `entry - prev_entry`)."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"Breaking Changes\">⚠️</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - 将 `$raycast.pierce_distance`（增量）替换为 `$raycast.prev_entry_distance` 和 `$raycast.prev_exit_distance`（绝对值）。手动计算增量以获得更大灵活性（例如，`entry - prev_entry`）。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:59 496ccfdcc3a54369a1e2d308beaa4ca8
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - Added `$raycast.entry_point.[x,y,z]` and `$raycast.exit_point.[x,y,z]` lambda scores for precise hit positions relative to the target."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - 新增了 `$raycast.entry_point.[x,y,z]` 和 `$raycast.exit_point.[x,y,z]` lambda 分数，用于精确确定相对于目标的命中位置。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:60 459cae44ead84ef98e10ca40fea134e8
msgid "<abbr title=\"New Features\">✨</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - Added `$raycast.targeted_block.[x,y,z]` lambda scores for targeted block coordinates."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"新功能\">✨</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - 为目标方块坐标添加了`$raycast.targeted_block.[x,y,z]` lambda 分数。"

#: ../../../changelog/v4.0.0.md:61 5eda5dcb46024b768ac3d907435bd0c1
msgid "<abbr title=\"Documentation\">📝</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - Improved documentation with comprehensive \"How to use\" section including examples for callbacks, filtering, piercing, and hitbox providers."
msgstr "<abbr title=\"文档\">📝</abbr> **[#531](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/pull/531)** - 改进了文档，添加了全面的\"How to use\"部分，包含回调、过滤、穿透和碰撞箱提供者的示例。"
